<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-478] Paragraph status not getting updated in a scenario as described in description</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-478</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The following is in case of FIFO scheduler&lt;br/&gt;
1.Run a  para(say para1-&amp;gt; %sh sleep 100). The status of the para is &quot;RUNNING&quot;.&lt;br/&gt;
 A new last para(say para2) is created&lt;br/&gt;
2.Now run some thing from para2.(eg: %sh ls )(para1 should be &quot;RUNNING&quot;)&lt;br/&gt;
Expected: The status of para2 should be &quot;PENDING&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
Current: The status of para2 is &quot;READY&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
